{"seq":1,"slug":"hash-ring","title":"哈希环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/hash-ring","wordCount":1589,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"哈希环\">哈希环</h1><p>哈希环是 <a href=\"../foundations/consistent-hashing-basics\">一致性哈希基础</a> 里那个「环形空间」从直觉走向可运行代码的地方。这一篇把环上的查找、插入、删除三个操作的数据结构、算法和复杂度讲到能直接照着实现的程度，并交代实现时最容易出错的几个细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>哈希环把哈希函数的值域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 2^{32})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 想象成一个首尾相连的圆。机器和键都被同一个哈希函数映射到圆上某一点，键归属于沿顺时针方向遇到的第一台机器。所以一台机器实际负责的，是「从它逆时针方向上一台机器的位置（不含）到它自己位置（含）」这一段弧上的所有键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>做什么</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定位 lookup</td>\n<td>找 key 顺时针的第一台机器</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无副作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加入 add</td>\n<td>在环上插入新机器点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅顺时针邻居的一段弧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除 remove</td>\n<td>移除机器点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>该机器的弧并入下一台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 通常指环上点的总数（含虚拟节点）。下面的图刻画一次定位是如何沿环顺时针落到负责机器的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[计算 h-key] --&gt; B[在有序结构中&lt;br/&gt;二分查找]&#10;  B --&gt; C{存在 &gt;= h-key&lt;br/&gt;的节点点位?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[返回该节点]&#10;  C --&gt;|否, 已越过环尾| E[回绕到环首&lt;br/&gt;返回第一个节点]&#10;  D --&gt; F[该节点负责此 key]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[计算 h-key] --&gt; B[在有序结构中&lt;br/&gt;二分查找]\n  B --&gt; C{存在 &gt;= h-key&lt;br/&gt;的节点点位?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[返回该节点]\n  C --&gt;|否, 已越过环尾| E[回绕到环首&lt;br/&gt;返回第一个节点]\n  D --&gt; F[该节点负责此 key]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"用有序结构承载环\">用有序结构承载环</h2><p>环不是真有一个圆，而是用一个按点位排序的有序结构来表示，最常见的是平衡二叉搜索树（如红黑树、TreeMap）或一个排好序的数组。每个元素是一个点位 → 机器的映射。</p>\n<p>定位一个键的步骤是：算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = hash(key)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在有序结构里二分查找第一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的点位，它对应的机器就是答案。如果没有任何点位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，说明键落在了环的尾部，要回绕到环首，返回最小点位对应的机器——这个回绕（wrap-around）是实现里第一个高频 bug 点，漏掉它会让落在最大点位之后的键全部定位失败。</p>\n<p>用有序数组实现时，定位是一次二分查找，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且常数小、缓存友好，适合点位集合相对稳定的场景；用平衡树实现时，插入删除也是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，适合点位频繁变动的场景。多数生产实现选有序数组 + 二分，配合「重建数组」来处理偶发的节点增删。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加入与删除-局部性从何而来\">加入与删除：局部性从何而来</h2><p>加入一台机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>：算出它的点位，插入有序结构。受影响的键，只有「从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 逆时针上一台机器的位置到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 位置」这段弧上的键——它们原本归属于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 顺时针的下一台机器，现在改归 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>。其余所有键纹丝不动。这就是 <a href=\"../foundations/consistent-hashing-basics\">一致性哈希基础</a> 所说单调性的具体兑现。</p>\n<p>删除一台机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>：把它的点位从结构里移除。它原本负责的那段弧上的键，全部并入它顺时针的下一台机器。同样，其余机器的键不受影响。无论加入还是删除，被搅动的键期望约为总量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>需要点名一个陷阱：加入和删除的影响范围只覆盖「一个邻接关系」，所以如果你恰好关心数据迁移，迁移源/目标是确定的相邻两台机器，可以精确地只在它们之间拷数据。具体的数据流动机制见 <a href=\"../practice/rebalancing\">再平衡</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现细节里的魔鬼\">实现细节里的魔鬼</h2><p>几个反复让人栽跟头的细节值得单独列出。</p>\n<p>第一是哈希函数的选择。环要求哈希值在值域上尽量均匀，且计算要快。生产里常用 MurmurHash3、xxHash 这类非加密哈希；除非有对抗性输入需求，否则不必用 MD5/SHA 这类加密哈希，它们慢且没必要。哈希函数选得差会直接放大下面要说的负载倾斜。</p>\n<p>第二是负载倾斜。裸环上每台机器只占一个点，弧长由相邻随机点位之差决定，方差很大——理论上最重的机器可能扛到平均的若干倍。这不是 bug 而是裸环的固有缺陷，标准解法是 <a href=\"virtual-nodes\">虚拟节点</a>：让一台物理机在环上占据上百个点，用大数定律把弧长方差压下去。</p>\n<p>第三是点位冲突。两台机器（或两个虚拟节点）哈希到同一点位时要有确定的打破平局规则，否则定位结果会随插入顺序漂移，破坏 <a href=\"../foundations/consistent-hashing-basics\">一致性哈希基础</a> 里的分散性。</p>\n<p>这几个细节之所以危险，是因为它们都不报错、只在特定输入下悄悄给出错误归属。把症状、根因和解法摆在一起，便于在实现和排障时对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>落在最大点位之后的键定位失败</td>\n<td>漏掉回绕（wrap-around）</td>\n<td>二分落空时返回最小点位对应的机器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少数机器负载远高于平均</td>\n<td>裸环单点、弧长方差大</td>\n<td>引入 <a href=\"virtual-nodes\">虚拟节点</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一点位归属随插入顺序漂移</td>\n<td>缺打破平局规则</td>\n<td>点位相同时按确定次序（如机器 id）裁决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定位偶发偏慢</td>\n<td>哈希函数分布差或过慢</td>\n<td>改用 MurmurHash3、xxHash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>围绕哈希环的实现，有几个反模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用加密哈希（MD5/SHA）求点位——慢且对分布无帮助，除非确有对抗性输入需求。</li>\n<li>有序结构在每次节点增删后全量重排——应当只做一次插入/删除，其余顺序不动。</li>\n<li>定位前不校验空环——集群为空时二分无结果，需明确返回「无可用节点」而非任取。</li>\n<li>把裸环直接用于生产而不加虚拟节点——负载倾斜会直接把个别机器压垮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>哈希环用一个按点位排序的有序结构（数组+二分或平衡树）表示，定位是查找第一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的点位，落空则回绕环首。</li>\n<li>三个操作均为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；加入/删除只影响一个邻接关系上的一段弧，迁移量期望约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>回绕处理、哈希函数选择、点位冲突打破平局是三个高频 bug 点。</li>\n<li>裸环负载倾斜严重，需用 <a href=\"virtual-nodes\">虚拟节点</a> 修补；数据如何真正搬动见 <a href=\"../practice/rebalancing\">再平衡</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哈希环","id":"哈希环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用有序结构承载环","id":"用有序结构承载环"},{"level":2,"text":"加入与删除：局部性从何而来","id":"加入与删除-局部性从何而来"},{"level":2,"text":"实现细节里的魔鬼","id":"实现细节里的魔鬼"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"一致性哈希基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/consistent-hashing-basics"},"next":{"title":"虚拟节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/virtual-nodes"}}